---
import background from "../assets/bakery-background.jpg";
import bakeryStore from "../assets/bakery-store.jpg";
import bakeryStoreOutside from "../assets/bakery-store-outside.jpg"
import "../styles/About.css"
---
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gravitas+One&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<div id="container">
  <img id="background" src={background.src} alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
  <main>
    <section >
      <h1>About Us</h1>
    </section>

    <section id="about-us-section">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>{`Our story began with a simple idea: that the best moments in life are often shared over freshly baked 
           bread and something sweet from the oven. What started as a small home kitchen, filled with the comforting 
           aroma of butter, flour, and sugar, slowly grew into a bakery built on passion, patience, and a dedication 
           to doing things the right way.
           
           In the early days, every recipe was tested, refined, and perfected by hand. Long hours were spent learning 
           the balance between tradition and creativity—honoring classic baking methods while adding our own 
           unique touch. What kept us going was not just the love for baking, but the joy of seeing people smile with 
           every bite.
           As word spread, our little operation began to grow. 
           Neighbors became regulars, regulars became a community, and the bakery became a space where people could 
           come together. Through every stage of growth, we stayed true to our roots: using quality ingredients, 
           baking fresh daily, and never cutting corners.

           Today, we continue to build on that foundation. While the bakery may have grown, our values remain the same.
           Every loaf, every pastry, and every cake tells a part of our story—a story of passion, perseverance, and a 
           genuine love for bringing people together through food.`}
      </p>
      <section id="pictures-section">

        <div id="bakery-store-image-container">
          <img src={bakeryStore.src} alt=""/>
          <img src={bakeryStoreOutside.src} alt=""/>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>
    
  </main>

  <a href="https://astro.build/blog/astro-6-beta/" id="news" class="box">
    <svg width="32" height="32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      ><path
        d="M24.667 12c1.333 1.414 2 3.192 2 5.334 0 4.62-4.934 5.7-7.334 12C18.444 28.567 18 27.456 18 26c0-4.642 6.667-7.053 6.667-14Zm-5.334-5.333c1.6 1.65 2.4 3.43 2.4 5.333 0 6.602-8.06 7.59-6.4 17.334C13.111 27.787 12 25.564 12 22.666c0-4.434 7.333-8 7.333-16Zm-6-5.333C15.111 3.555 16 5.556 16 7.333c0 8.333-11.333 10.962-5.333 22-3.488-.774-6-4-6-8 0-8.667 8.666-10 8.666-20Z"
        fill="#111827"></path></svg
    >
    <h2>What's New in Astro 6.0?</h2>
    <p>
      Redesigned dev server, fonts, live collections, built-in CSP support, and
      more! Click to explore Astro 6.0's new features.
    </p>
  </a>
</div>
